#created by Duel Circuit - No Limits: Fiendsmith Yubel, autumn 2024 (Rue "Lacrima")
#title Fiendsmith Kashtira Yubel (2024, uncut)
#era 2024
#tier No Limits peak build: pool (docs/dev/NO-LIMITS-SPEC-2026-11-02.md section 5)
#about Won YCS Cancun (October 2024), the autumn Yubel led every premier top cut (21.7%) and took the world title. Spirit of Yubel, Samsara D Lotus and Nightmare Throne build a resilient Fiend board that burns and removes on both turns; Fiendsmith and Kashtira add the extenders. Here Fiendsmith's Lacrima, Forbidden the month before, comes home, with three Opening of the Spirit Gates and the old Fiend searchers digging for Yubel.
#why Peak list: October 2024; restored: Fiendsmith's Lacrima (Extra, 1), Phantom of Yubel (Extra, 2), Opening of the Spirit Gates x3; picks: Sangan, Witch of the Black Forest; cuts: Dark Ruler No More x2 (flex), Muckraker From the Underworld (Extra). Measured 2026-11-03: rated 1696 (+43 over yubel 1653).
#banlist TCG September 2024
